From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:12:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 097/102] Site controls: Arc's Extensions row with the shown
 space's extensions

Every extension with a toolbar action of the active tab's profile (a
space's), as tiles with its icon and badge for the tab, not only pinned
ones; a click runs it on the tab and its popup opens, in the extension's
profile, under the sliders. Manage opens chrome://extensions of that
space. Chromium's toolbar stays, hidden, for its shortcuts and bubbles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
